    {
      "id": "131aa369-d124-4aa4-b6ab-43bb9bcda758",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Coverage\n\nPossession exists only where ESPN tracks it — effectively the 2000s\nonward, and patchier outside the major leagues. The Premier League has\nnear-complete coverage from 2001/02; lower-profile leagues have\nsporadic seasons. Everything below is computed only on matches where\n**both** teams have a valid possession figure.",
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "405f0cc9-69ef-4937-bacc-b5f9a5d2dabc",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "\n// EPL coverage by season\nlet mut by_season: std::collections::BTreeMap<String, usize> = std::collections::BTreeMap::new();\nfor r in &epl { *by_season.entry(r.season.clone()).or_insert(0) += 1; }\nlet rows_s: Vec<Vec<String>> = by_season.iter().map(|(s, n)| vec![s.clone(), n.to_string()]).collect();\nmars_table(&[\"EPL season\", \"matches with possession\"], &rows_s);\n",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": 2,
      "outputs": [
